  "body": "Enjoy contemporary design, quality finishes and an easy coastal lifestyle in this beautifully designed three-bedroom townhouse.\r\n\r\nDesigned with everyday living and entertaining in mind, the home features a light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area that opens out to private, landscaped courtyards. The designer kitchen forms the heart of the home, with stone benchtops, quality appliances and generous storage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the generous master suite provides a peaceful retreat, complete with two double wardrobes and a private ensuite. Two further bedrooms offer flexibility for family, guests or working from home, supported by a well-appointed main bathroom and plenty of storage throughout.\r\n\r\nOutside, the landscaped courtyards provide an easy extension of the living space — ideal for morning coffee, summer entertaining or simply enjoying the sunshine.\r\n\r\nLocated just minutes from Red Beach, you’ll have parks, local cafés, shops and schools close by, with the beach and surrounding recreational amenities making it easy to embrace the laid-back coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n3 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\nWindow furnishings included\r\nInternal-access garage\r\nLight-filled open-plan living and dining\r\nDesigner kitchen with stone benchtops and quality appliances\r\nPrivate, landscaped courtyards\r\nMaster suite with ensuite, two double wardrobes and balcony\r\nQuality finishes and fixtures throughout\r\nClose to Red Beach, parks, cafés, shops and schools\r\n\r\nSelected images have been digitally styled to illustrate how the spaces can be furnished and enjoyed.",
